          "name": "Out Sample Data List",
          "type": "TArray<FBlendSampleData>&"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Out Cached Triangulation Index",
          "type": "Int&"
        },
        {
          "name": "Combine Animations",
          "type": "Bool"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Get Grid Samples from BlendInput\nIt will return all samples that has weight > KINDA_SMALL_NUMBER\n@param\tBlendInput\tBlendInput X, Y, Z corresponds to BlendParameters[0], [1], [2]\n@param\tInOutCachedTriangulationIndex\tThe previous index into triangulation/segmentation to warm-start the search.\n@param\tbCombineAnimations\tWill combine samples that point to the same animation. Useful when processing, but confusing when viewing\n@return\ttrue if it has valid OutSampleDataList, false otherwise"
    },
